{
  "_doc": "The application's distributions. Each series is one seed the platform's crystallizer (python spawn.py <series>) cuts; the schema is the platform specification's 'Series declaration'. Paths are relative to the application root. Groups station, feeds and labs hold what needs a key, a network or a model at first run (the station's LLM/X programmes, the live feeds, the laboratories' precompute); the `seeds13` series selects none of them and ships no archives-only page.",
  "default": "seeds",
  "groups": {
    "pages": {
      "paths": [
        "archives/",
        "scripts/shelf_setup.py",
        "scripts/shelf_reading_cycle.py"
      ]
